"Add to |cFF9cdcfeQueue|r ",
},
["Name"] = "This setting is applied when you've run out of marks.|n|nAdd to |cFF9cdcfeQueue|r - will send the npc to a queue. So that when new marks become available it will automatically remark this npc. ",
