"|cFF4f4e4f|cFFdcd69dUnit Dies|r or |cFFb670d6Timed|r|r",
"|cFF4f4e4f|cFFff6150Mark but don't save|r - Mark can be used right away by other mobs|r",
},
["Name"] = "All |cFFff7675Marks|r become available when the player goes out of combat. But on spiteful weeks or when chain pulling the player can sometimes get stuck in combat for a long time. Use this option to help with that.",
