{
["type"] = "description",
["text"] = "Toggle the 'Enable' option if you wish to assume the role of Automarker when assigned the corresponding role in the party. If disabled, this role will be relinquished to another party member who also has this WeakAura installed. Collaboration is key; ensuring everyone in the party has the WeakAura installed enables seamless coordination of marking responsibilities.\n\n|cFFff7675Priority list when assigning who will mark|r: \n\n|A:roleicon-tiny-tank:0:0|a |cFFC79C6ETank|r  >  |T132062:0|t |cFF3A92EFLeader|r  >  |A:roleicon-tiny-dps:0:0|a |cFF8788EEDPS|r with highest M+ score  >  |A:roleicon-tiny-healer:0:0|a |cFFF48CBAHealer|r",
