{
["type"] = "description",
["text"] = "This feature provides a set of global options for your convenience. While the WeakAura is configured to utilize these settings by default, it's essential to note that you have the flexibility to customize settings for individual mobs as needed. To do so, simply navigate to the dungeon interface, select the specific mob, access the custom options, and choose your preferred setting. This allows for fine-tuning on a per-mob basis to suit your preferences and gameplay requirements.",
