["type"] = "description",
["text"] = "Choose whether you'd like to automatically mark the tank or healer. With this setting enabled, WeakAura will periodically check throughout the dungeon to ensure that the marks remain intact. If they are lost, WeakAura will automatically reapply them, maintaining consistent marking for efficient gameplay.\n\n|cFFFF0000!|r Player Marks override the Enable / Disable from Mark Order Settings",
